# Private BCSO PAB Bot Sandbox configuration
#
# This file is safe to commit because it contains no token or application client ID.
# Copy it to the protected runtime .env on the sandbox host, then fill only the
# two values below from the Discord Developer Portal. Never paste a token into Discord.
